<tr>
	<td width="536" height="26" bgcolor="#C0C0C0"><font color="#666666"><b>16th March</B></font>
    </tr>
    <tr>
	 <td width="536" height="26" bgcolor="#808080">
        <BR>


<B>GoD progress</B> <P>
<font size="3">


You know... this expansion aint half bad. <P>

We been working through the new raid content, mostly focusing on Ikkiniz and its been
a lotta fun. Some _very_ cool encounters in Ikkiniz, possibly my favourite current zone.<P>

We dropped Pixtt Suir Mindrider to discover it had pretty bland Time tier 4 level loots. Nothing
too shabby, but nothing to get too exited about:<P>

Watz:<BR>
<img  src="http://www.afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1168.jpg" > <P>


Along side our usual plane of time farming, we've found time to reflag a few elemental gods for
potime access and push into Ikkiniz, which seems to be at the heart of the expansion. We've completed
the trials of: Righteousness,Glorification and ummm the other one.<P>

Loots here were a little bit more up to par:<P>

<img  src="http://afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1172.jpg" > 
<img  src="http://afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1186.jpg" > 
<img  src="http://afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1183.jpg" > 
<img  src="http://afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1171.jpg" > 
<img  src="http://afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1194.jpg" > 
<img  src="http://afterlifeguild.org/itemdb/1172.jpg" > <P>

And a whole load of other stuff. Nice to see useful rewards at this stage of an expansion<P>

Some altar boy next, and then we'll need a new zone to pillage!<P>

Grats too all those who completed the raid trials, and a warm welcome to our latest new members. <P>




</tr>






<tr>
